00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.230
<b>I'm hungry, Shido!</b>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.150
<b>Shidou, I gotta go potty.</b>

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.150
<b>Darling! Darling!</b>

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.900
<b>U-Um, Shidou-san?</b>

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.240
<b>Shido!</b>

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:15.660
<b>I want something to eat!</b>

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.850
<b>Kaguya, that's my candy!</b>

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.060
<b>Oh, calm down.</b>

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:26.080
<b>Worrying over insignificant things like this only shows how stingy you are.</b>

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.920
<b>Agreeing: Just one isn't going to hurt anyone.</b>

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:35.270
<b>Fine, fine! Just calm down, everyone!</b>

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:43.600
<b><i>Why did you do this, Natsumi?</i></b>

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.900
<b>You look like you could use some help, Shin.</b>

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.110
<b>Reine-san!</b>

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:54.100
<b>Sorry, I can't handle them all by myself.</b>

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:58.770
<b>Don't be. I feel bad for making you take care of all of them.</b>

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:07.710
<b>So, any word on Natsumi?</b>

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:12.730
<b>We've been searching everywhere for her,
 but nothing's come up yet.</b>

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.760
<b>We'll let you know as soon as we find something.</b>

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:17.780
<b>Got it.</b>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:20.680
<b>But why do you think Natsumi did this?</b>

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:22.720
<b>Good question.</b>

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:27.190
<b>It might've been a last resort move of desperation.</b>

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:34.460
<b>She also could have meant this to be a warning by decreasing the strength of the spirits.</b>

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:37.990
<b>Or maybe it was just her way of getting back at you?</b>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:47.500
<b>Our investigation shows that there are six spirits within close proximity to Itsuka Shidou.</b>

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:52.290
<b>You'll deploy immediately after you finish your preparations, Ellen.</b>

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.860
<b>Understood. Who should I start with?</b>

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:01.800
<b>This is the spirit the AST's reported on the other day.</b>

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:06.980
<b>Her presence was confirmed around Tenguu City,
 but she hasn't been spotted in some time.</b>

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:09.290
<b>She takes top priority.</b>

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:17.060
