<b><i>Looks like Natsumi hasn't done anything to them.</i></b>

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.040
<b>Morning, Itsuka.</b>

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.730
<b>H-Hey.</b>

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:08.580
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.800
<b>N-Nothing.</b>

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.770
<b>Um, Itsuka-kun?</b>

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:13.680
<b>Yes?</b>

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:16.900
<b>Someone's here to see you. Um...</b>

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.150
<b>Really?</b>

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:19.890
<b>Well...</b>

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.880
<b>Shido! I knew you'd be here!</b>

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:26.520
<b>Bad girl! I told you to wait in the staff room!</b>

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:27.830
<b>What's going on here?</b>

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.650
<b>Hindrance: You're in our way.</b>

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:33.290
<b>Shidou, can you hear me? We have an emergency.</b>

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.840
<b>Tohka and the others aren't in the house!</b>

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:38.290
<b>Yeah, they're here.</b>

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:43.530
<b>Shidou, explain to this teacher here that we're students of class 2-3—</b>

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:45.670
<b>that we're the Yamai twins!</b>

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:50.180
<b>Sighing: You can't judge a book by its cover.</b>

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:53.290
<b>I told you all to wait at home, didn't I?</b>

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.090
<b>Are you crazy? We have school today!</b>

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:57.360
<b>True, but...</b>

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.980
<b>Hey, what's your name, little girl?</b>

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.320
<b>Itsuka Chiyogami.</b>

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.360
<b>Thank you for being friends with my Papa.</b>

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.460
<b>P-Papa?!</b>

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.570
<b>No! This is all a big misunderstanding!</b>

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:12.420
<b>These girls are, uh... a relative's kids! {my little cousins}</b>

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:14.840
<b>I'm just babysitting them!</b>

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:18.290
<b>Papa is just like a nickname!</b>

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:23.050
<b>Man, thanks to your reputation,
 I almost believed her for a second.</b>

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.970
<b>Yeah, well no way I'm a dad.</b>

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:28.120
<b>Okay guys, let's go home, huh?</b>

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.280
<b>What's going...</b>

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.470
<b>What's wrong Tohk—</b>

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:35.100
<b>What are you doing, Shido?!</b>

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.600
<b>What'd you do, you bastard?!</b>

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:38.810
<b>You monster!</b>

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.100
<b>So gross!</b>

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:42.320
<b>I-I didn't do any...</b>

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:43.360
<b>That light!</b>

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:44.910
<b>Was it...</b>

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:47.580
<b>Okay guys, time to go home!</b>

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.740
<b>He's running away!</b>

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:50.240
<b>Shidou!</b>

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.930
<b>What happened?!</b>

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:52.870
<b>The house!</b>

