00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:40.850
<b>Reine-san?!</b>

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:43.730
<b>She's not holding back, is she?</b>

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:47.480
<b>But thanks to that, we've been able to get a lock on her.</b>

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.740
<b>Really? Where is she?!</b>

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:56.660
<b>This is hilarious. Serves you right.</b>

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.250
<b>This is what you get for embarrassing me like that.</b>

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:01.060
<b>Now then, next I'll...</b>

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:02.800
<b>Something's coming this way.</b>

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:05.180
<b>Is it one of Shidou-kun's allies?</b>

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:08.130
<b>Too bad though. I'm not gonna let myself get caught.</b>

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:33.760
<b>That's quite the violent greeting,
 especially from a friend of Shidou-kun.</b>

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:39.200
<b>Unfortunately for you, I am no friend of Itsuka Shidou.</b>

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.850
<b>Then I take it you're with the AST?</b>

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:44.160
<b>Not that it really matters anyway.</b>

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.210
<b>What do you want?</b>

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:51.210
<b>I'm here to capture you. {hunt you}</b>

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.970
<b>Oh? I doubt you can.</b>

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:58.430
<b>There's only one way to find out.</b>

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:03.140
<b>Are you so confident because of them?</b>

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:13.990
<b>Not at all.</b>

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:16.360
<b>Well, not that I care!</b>

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.300
<b>How dare you!</b>

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:32.620
<b>Haniel!</b>

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:45.180
<b>Oh, you're giving me candy? How nice.</b>

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:47.730
<b>Let me return the favor!</b>

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.760
<b>Ellen-sama?!</b>

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.030
<b>Wh-What happened?</b>

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:58.740
<b>You're much cuter now.</b>

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.490
<b>Your move.</b>

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.930
<b>It's not over yet.</b>

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:07.000
<b>I can still kill you easily.</b>

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:22.410
<b>Wh-What did you do?!</b>

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:28.470
<b>I missed your vitals.</b>

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.370
<b>I guess my power really was reduced.</b>

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:35.280
<b>Now then...</b>

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:39.280
<b>No! Save me! Save me!</b>

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:42.160
<b>Don't worry. It'll be over in a flash.</b>

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.260
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:10:57.570 --> 00:11:00.260
<b>Wh-Why are you here?</b>

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.750
<b>Gabriel! Rondo!</b>

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:09.270
<b>Too easy!</b>

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:12.270
<b>Sneering: Pathetic.</b>

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:13.920
<b>Why?</b>

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:15.770
<b>Natsumi!</b>

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.110
<b>Shidou-kun?</b>

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:19.140
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:20.780
<b>We're here to help!{TLC}{忠良 is loyalty, while it is difficult to put an exact english equivalent down, what he's saying that he's on her side and has that sense of loyalty to her. I think the translation is better than what I would put down to be frank. It's short and simple. Lore wise, it does make sense as Shidou has tried to save every spirit he encounters, Natsumi is no exception. It's right.}</b>

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:22.780
<b>You think I'll let you?</b>

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:25.290
<b>Think you can stop us, Ellen-san?</b>

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:27.660
<b>Your allies seem to be down for the count.</b>

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.660
<b>You're outnumbered.</b>

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:33.880
<b>Don't worry, I never counted them in the first place.</b>

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:36.600
<b>Really? In that case...</b>

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.700
<b>Miku!</b>

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.530
<b>Now, Kotori!</b>

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:51.560
<b>Just hang in there a little longer, Natsumi!</b>

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:56.820
<b>Why... I don't understand...</b>

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:12.670
<b>I require more useful pawns.</b>

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:15.920
<b>Mr. Simpson.</b>

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:22.430
<b>Do you know how many satellites our company has in orbit right now?</b>

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:23.280
<b>No.</b>

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:24.930
<b>Twenty-three.</b>

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:29.620
<b>Of those twenty three, eight are scheduled to be disposed of.</b>

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:33.040
<b>Wait, I'm not following.</b>

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:35.380
<b>What are you getting at?</b>

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.320
<b>No, Murdoch... You're not trying to...</b>

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:39.940
<b>I am.</b>

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.820
<b>We're going to <i>dispose</i> of them.</b>

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:47.070
<b>We'll drop those satellites right on top of Tenguu city.</b>

00:12:58.930 --> 00:12:59.780
<b>Yes?</b>

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:04.300
<b>Disciplinary action? Me?</b>

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.700
<b>On what grounds?</b>

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:40.570
<b><i>Even for disciplinary action,
 this is quite severe. What's going on?</i></b>

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.760
<b>That was fast, Shidou.</b>

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.930
<b>Natsumi's awake now?</b>

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:53.180
<b>Since a minute ago.</b>

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:54.780
<b>Natsumi...</b>

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:59.940
<b>She can't use her angel for a bit because of the injury Ellen gave her,</b>

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.200
<b>but don't let your guard down. {Wow they made her a lot cuter than in the light novel. She's supposed to have like really frizzy hair and all that}</b>

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:03.150
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.440
<b>What happened to your face?</b>

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:09.950
<b>Uh, well, just be on your guard.</b>

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.330
<b>Oh... okay.</b>

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.310
<b>Hey, Natsumi.</b>

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:17.100
<b>Wha—</b>

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.900
<b>Calm down, Natsumi!</b>

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:20.160
<b>Don't look at me!</b>

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:22.200
<b>Don't be like that.</b>

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:26.420
<b>Why did you save me?</b>

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:30.130
<b>Why? I mean, you were about to be killed by Ellen.</b>

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.040
<b>That's not what I mean!</b>

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:36.230
<b>I've transformed into you and even made your friends disappear!</b>

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.250
<b>Well yeah, sure.</b>

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:41.230
<b>But why wouldn't I save you?</b>

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:46.490
<b>Shut up! I won't be fooled by your words!</b>

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:49.050
<b>I'm not trying to fool you.</b>

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.090
<b>So, Natsumi...</b>

00:14:53.090 --> 00:14:53.980
<b>What?</b>

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:57.910
<b>Why <i>did</i> you transform into me and make my friends disappear?</b>

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:02.000
<b>Because you discovered my secret. Isn't that obvious?</b>

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.750
<b>What secret?</b>

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:07.260
<b>What I actually look like.</b>

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.130
<b>Wait a minute.</b>

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:11.890
<b>Why is it so bad for people to see what you really look like?{Hold up, is this ecchi harem actually pushing good morals?}</b>

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.160
<b><i>Why</i>?!</b>

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:18.890
<b>You really think I could just let it slide after you saw this mess?!{TLC}{Do you honestly think I can be calm after you witnessed my true form?}{I used true form as she accidentally exposed it and is the mess the original is referring to. His line is smoother than mine.}</b>

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:21.900
<b>Natsumi, uh—</b>

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:25.980
<b>You called me pretty when we first met, remember?</b>

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:28.650
<b>If you'd met me when I was like this,
 would you still react the same way?!</b>

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:31.740
<b>You might've just ignored me outright!</b>

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:32.990
<b>No, that wouldn—</b>

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.740
<b>It would!</b>

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:40.670
<b>No one in this world's ever given me so much as a second glance when I look like this!</b>

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:45.840
<b>In any case, I can't forgive anyone who's seen my real form!</b>

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.100
<b>Got it?! Now get out!</b>

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:50.850
<b>But you know, Natsumi?</b>

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:53.870
<b>What's so bad about the way you look now?</b>

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.280
<b>Don't tell me I didn't warn you.</b>

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:04.110
<b>How does her mentality look?{QC - Someone who understands these terms, pls help.}</b>

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:09.110
<b>There's been fluctuations, but it's nowhere near a level where she can be sealed.</b>

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.800
<b>Thought as much.</b>

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:14.620
<b>I don't think she has any confidence in the way she looks now.</b>

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:17.620
<b>It wouldn't make sense for her to transform otherwise.</b>

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:21.980
<b>I think Natsumi's attractive enough the way she is now.</b>

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:24.540
<b>If we can just get her to realize that...</b>

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:28.300
<b>Even though she's been transforming to hide what she really looks like?</b>

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.340
<b>Transform...</b>

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.340
<b>Transform...</b>

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:56.100
<b>But you know, Natsumi?</b>

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:59.450
<b>What's so bad about the way you look now?</b>

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.640
<b>I'm not gonna be fooled that easily!</b>

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:07.360
<b>I'm gonna get you all back when I can use Haniel again!</b>

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.360
<b><i>Wh-What's going o—</i></b>

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:11.460
<b>Gotcha!</b>

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.720
<b>No! {Stop!!}</b>

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:16.380
<b>Okay, go ahead.</b>

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:22.230
<b>Huh? Where am I?</b>

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:27.480
<b>Welcome to the Miku Beauty Salon, opened today just for you!</b>

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.610
<b>Huh?! What is all this?</b>

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:33.610
<b>Miku just told you. It's a beauty salon.{Yeah you dumb idiot.}</b>

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:35.450
<b>You're not making sense.</b>

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:40.620
<b>You're just here to make fun of me for being so ugly—</b>

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.090
<b>Just shut up and lay down.</b>

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:45.060
<b>We've got other plans.</b>

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:46.040
<b>Plans?</b>

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:51.460
<b>Natsumi, we're going to do everything we can today to transform you.</b>

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.970
<b>If we succeed, it's our win.</b>

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:56.670
<b>If nothing changes, we lose.</b>

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:58.720
<b>In that case, you can do whatever you want.</b>

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.720
<b>Like what?</b>

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.000
<b>Hm, how about...</b>

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:06.040
<b>You can run away wherever you want.</b>

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:10.610
<b>Deal.</b>

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:16.240
<b>We'll show you that girls can transform even without the help of an angel.</b>

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:20.160
<b>I'm going to spread some oil on you. {Looks like it's time to oil up! https://youtu.be/8psK-V1brvw?t=25}</b>

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.120
<b>This won't do anything.</b>

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:25.280
<b>These stones will warm you right up.</b>

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:26.610
<b>How's it feel?</b>

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:27.870
<b>Perfect.</b>

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:31.220
<b>This'll make all the swelling in your legs go away.</b>

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.880
<b>O-Oh really...</b>

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:36.150
<b>Does it feel good?</b>

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:39.710
<b>You should take better care of your skin.</b>

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:43.540
<b>No matter what I do, it won't change any...</b>

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.570
<b>Looks like you slept well.</b>

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:51.890
<b>Head on to the next room.</b>

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:53.270
<b>Okay.</b>

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.920
<b>Just sit back and watch while we work our magic!</b>

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:13.880
<b>And after the beauty parlor is...</b>

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.840
<b>Please, right this way.</b>

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.130
<b>Come on in!</b>

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.620
<b>Oh, that's perfect!</b>

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:22.010
<b>It's very cute!</b>

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.510
<b>Over here next!</b>

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:24.140
<b>And this is the last room of the Natsumi transformation project.</b>

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:24.260
<b>And this is the last room of the Natsumi transformation project.</b>

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:24.390
<b>And this is the last room of the Natsumi transformation project.</b>

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:28.020
<b>And this is the last room of the Natsumi transformation project.</b>

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:32.230
<b>The name's Shiori. I'm going to completely transform you with my makeup skills.</b>

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.110
<b>This won't change a thi—</b>

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.110
<b>Do you really think so?</b>

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.360
<b>Of course!</b>

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:40.110
<b>But what if...</b>

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:43.120
<b>I told you that I was actually a guy?!</b>

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:46.500
<b>Pervert.</b>

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.540
<b>Oh, that seemed to cut real deep. {That stung quite a bit!}{Less literal}</b>

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:56.250
<b>It's okay, Darling. If we just forget the fact that you're a guy, then you'll be a girl!</b>

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:58.390
<b>At any rate,</b>

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:04.390
<b>I'm going to use my amazing disguise skills to make you transform!</b>

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:06.920
<b>Do your worst.</b>

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.900
<b>All finished! {Lol he put the voice changer back on.}</b>

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.280
<b>What do you think, Natsumi?</b>

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:21.910
<b>Is this really me?</b>

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:24.780
<b><i>Wh-What's happening right now?</i></b>

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:27.580
<b><i>Why do they seem so happy?</i></b>

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:32.660
<b><i>I did all those mean things to them,
 and if I say I'm cute, then I lose.</i></b>

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:34.440
<b><i>But this really is...</i></b>

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.380
<b>Natsumi, careful! There's a—</b>

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:45.700
<b>Natsumi!</b>

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:46.780
<b>Natsumi!</b>

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.410
<b>Natsumi!</b>

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:49.010
<b>Are you okay, Natsumi?!</b>

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:53.770
<b>Who is this?</b>

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:56.270
<b>My name's Ellen Mathers.</b>

00:20:56.610 --> 00:21:00.280
<b>I presume that I'm speaking with Sergeant Tobiichi Origami.</b>

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.380
<b>Ellen Mathers?</b>

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:05.280
<b>What do you want?</b>

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:08.060
<b>I'll be frank.</b>

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:11.410
<b>Would you like to work for me, Sergeant Tobiichi?</b>

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:13.540
<b>I refuse.</b>

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:17.480
<b>I have no intention of aiding an organization that's caused Shidou harm.</b>

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:20.670
<b>There she is! This way!</b>

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:30.760
<b>Looks like you could use some help.</b>

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:36.360
<b>I hear you've been looking for details on the spirit that ravaged Tenguu City five years ago.</b>

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:43.240
<b>If you serve me, I wouldn't mind sharing some of the information we have.</b>

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:46.300
<b>Don't you want to avenge your parents?{QC/TLC - Did they die? Can I say "...you want to avenge your..."?}{Yeah, they did die. And yes the edit would be fine.}</b>

00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:49.220
<b>Fine.</b>

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:52.820
<b>What just...</b>

00:21:57.800 --> 00:22:01.630
<b>Welcome to DEM Industries. {Hell yeah, getting to the really fun arc.}</b>

